{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.BindingMassRung","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingMassRung","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Algebra.Order.Field"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingMassRung.bindingOverMass_tendsto_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingMassRung.bindingOverMass_tendsto_zero","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingMassRung.lean#L54-L63","doc":"**Binding/mass → 0 as `ℏ_q → 0`** (classical point): nuclear binding is a quantum correction\nthat vanishes classically, while rest mass (the pole above) diverges there. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingMassRung.massMultiplier_pole_residue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingMassRung.massMultiplier_pole_residue","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingMassRung.lean#L46-L52","doc":"**The mass multiplier is an order-2 pole with residue `lw`:** weighting by `ℏ_q²` recovers\nexactly the O(1) linking weight. Since `lw ≠ 0`, the pole is genuine (rest mass diverges as\n`ℏ_q → 0`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingMassRung.bindingOverMass_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingMassRung.bindingOverMass_eq","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingMassRung.lean#L39-L44","doc":"**Binding/mass is exactly `(M/lw)·ℏ_q²`.** The ratio is a pure order-`ℏ_q²` quantity — the\nrigorous form of \"binding sits one ℏ_q² rung below mass.\" ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingMassRung.bindingOverMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingMassRung.bindingOverMass","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingMassRung.lean#L35-L37","doc":"Binding-to-mass ratio at deformation `hbar`: the coordination count `M` over the mass\nmultiplier. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingMassRung.massMultiplier","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingMassRung.massMultiplier","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingMassRung.lean#L31-L33","doc":"Mass multiplier at deformation `hbar := ℏ_q`: the O(1) linking weight `lw` over the cusp\nfactor `ℏ_q²`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}